1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,946
Why did Dadi light a lamp every evening?

2
00:00:02,996 --> 00:00:07,322
The night was deep, and Pinku could not see the path.

3
00:00:07,372 --> 00:00:13,029
Dadi lit one small lamp, and everything became bright.

4
00:00:13,079 --> 00:00:16,761
Dadi said: in the dark, even one small lamp shows everyone the way.

5
00:00:16,811 --> 00:00:19,775
Tomorrow I'll tell you where Pinku put the next lamp.
